{
    "title": "Mamava - Breastfeed on the Go",
    "description": "Find thousands of lactation spaces to pump or breastfeed on the go, get and give support, access parent resources, and more. \r\n\r\nFEATURES\r\n\r\n- Find thousands of pumping and breastfeeding locations\u2014never a bathroom!\u2014wherever you are or wherever you\u2019re going via our smart technology system that empowers easy wayfinding.\r\n\r\n- Mamava pods are linked via Bluetooth for autonomous access, so there\u2019s no need to track down a key!\r\n\r\n- See a list of available amenities for each lactation space\u2014electrical outlets,, locking door,, sink, space for a stroller, etc.\r\n\r\n- Add your favorite lactation places to make the app better for everyone. The more locations in the app, the bigger the impact for breastfeeding parents.\r\n\r\n- Connect with other breastfeeding parents by giving (and receiving) a little uplift with the Words of Support community.\r\n\r\n- Get access to helpful breastfeeding tips, parent perspectives, and need-to-know info (like our state-by-state guide to breastfeeding laws).\r\n\r\n- Listen to Sounds for Letdown to get your milk flowing.\r\n\r\nABOUT\r\nFrom Mamava, the creator of freestanding lactation pods and the leading expert in lactation space design. Mamava is dedicated to transforming the culture of breastfeeding by providing freestanding lactation spaces designed to meet the needs of breastfeeding families.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Find thousands of lactation spaces to pump or breastfeed on the go, get and give support, access parent resources, and more. <br><br>FEATURES<br><br>- Find thousands of pumping and breastfeeding locations\u2014never a bathroom!\u2014wherever you are or wherever you\u2019re going via our smart technology system that empowers easy wayfinding.<br><br>- Mamava pods are linked via Bluetooth for autonomous access, so there\u2019s no need to track down a key!<br><br>- See a list of available amenities for each lactation space\u2014electrical outlets,, locking door,, sink, space for a stroller, etc.<br><br>- Add your favorite lactation places to make the app better for everyone. The more locations in the app, the bigger the impact for breastfeeding parents.<br><br>- Connect with other breastfeeding parents by giving (and receiving) a little uplift with the Words of Support community.<br><br>- Get access to helpful breastfeeding tips, parent perspectives, and need-to-know info (like our state-by-state guide to breastfeeding laws).<br><br>- Listen to Sounds for Letdown to get your milk flowing.<br><br>ABOUT<br>From Mamava, the creator of freestanding lactation pods and the leading expert in lactation space design. Mamava is dedicated to transforming the culture of breastfeeding by providing freestanding lactation spaces designed to meet the needs of breastfeeding families.",
